# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# UNIFIED MYCELIUM ECOSYSTEM - PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and update with your production values

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🧠 MYCELIUM HUB - LLM & Intent Engine
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# LLM Model Selection
MYCELIUM_OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:latest
# Options: qwen2.5-coder:latest, llama2, mistral, neural-chat

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🎯 FORGED INTENT - Rule Engine & Vision
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_forged_postgres_password_here_CHANGE_ME
POSTGRES_CENTRAL_PASSWORD=your_central_postgres_password_here_CHANGE_ME

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🔍 PRODUCTION MEMORY - Vector DB & Search
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

MINIO_PASSWORD=your_minio_password_here_CHANGE_ME
MONGODB_PASSWORD=your_mongodb_password_here_CHANGE_ME

# OpenAI API Key (if using MCP servers with OpenAI)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-api-key-here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 📰 CMS & CONTENT - WordPress & Baserow
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

WORDPRESS_DB_ROOT_PASSWORD=your_wordpress_root_password_here_CHANGE_ME
WORDPRESS_DB_PASSWORD=your_wordpress_db_password_here_CHANGE_ME

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NOTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 
# All passwords should be strong and randomly generated.
# Example secure password generation:
#   Linux/Mac: openssl rand -base64 32
#   PowerShell: [Convert]::ToBase64String((1..32|%{[byte](Get-Random -Max 256)}))
#
# Services accessible at:
#   - Mycelium Hub Dashboard: http://localhost:8082
#   - Mycelium API: http://localhost:8000
#   - Rule Engine: http://localhost:8080
#   - Jellyfin: http://localhost:8096
#   - Radarr: http://localhost:7878
#   - Sonarr: http://localhost:8989
#   - Jellyseerr: http://localhost:5055
#   - qBittorrent: http://localhost:8080
#   - WordPress: http://localhost:8081
#   - Baserow: http://localhost:3000
#   - Minio Console: http://localhost:9001
#   - Elasticsearch: http://localhost:9200
#   - Milvus: http://localhost:19530
#   - MongoDB: http://localhost:27017
#   - MailHog: http://localhost:8025
#
# Network: All services run on the "mycelium-net" Docker bridge network
#
